                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Congress can still stop these price hikes, but we have to act now.\n\nIf Republicans join us in extending ACA enhanced premium tax credits, we can prevent millions of Americans from being priced out of their health coverage. \nhttps://t.co/tPQfI3bZuM",
