                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "With open enrollment beginning tomorrow, I went to Greater Seacoast Community Health to speak with Granite Staters who will be impacted by soaring health insurance premiums. I\u2019m going to keep doing everything I can to prevent millions from losing their health coverage. https://t.co/uSl59kiNKU",
