                "reply_count": 99,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The health insurance Marketplace is open. Americans, who are already facing a cost of living crisis, are seeing drastically higher, unaffordable premiums. With millions of people counting on us, it\u2019s time to extend these tax credits. https://t.co/psml76G2Ov",
