                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 398,
                "retweet_count": 22,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019ve had discussions with folks in every corner of New Hampshire, and the message is clear: At a time when costs are going up, the ACA enhanced premium tax credits are a lifeline.\n\nCongress needs to act so that millions of people aren't priced out of life-saving health insurance.",
