                "reply_count": 34,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The fight to keep health care premiums from skyrocketing is far from over. I met with Granite Staters at the Center for Life Management in Derry to discuss the path forward to extend the ACA enhanced premium tax credits that people rely on to afford health insurance. https://t.co/YIimT0PjTY",
