                "reply_count": 69,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans need to join us to address the soon-expiring ACA enhanced premium tax credits so that tens of millions of people aren't priced out of the health insurance they rely on. It's critical that we work together in the Senate and the House to find a bipartisan solution.",
